title: Finance Ministry
subtitle: The Finance Ministry controls the government budget and taxes.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if leverage < 10 : We do not have enough leverage. ?][? if king_relation < 30 : The King will block our nomination to any economic Ministries due to his wariness. ?]
tags: mins_1919
choose-if: leverage >= 10 and king_relation >= 30
view-if: finance_minister_party != psi_name
on-arrival: leverage -= 10; finance_minister_party = psi_name; finance_minister = "Lazzari"
go-to: ministries

Constantinto Lazzari of the [+ psi_name +] has been appointed Finance Minister.

